{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2c0c3943-ebab-8e70-ad2a-f94f8dcb3fa3",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T10:07:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Lorraine. Tony Conti. I got a problem with the drain in front of my shop, 211 Farewell Street, North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 211 Farewell Street. And what's going on with the drain, Mr. Conti?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Grate at the curb sunk. Dropped down, maybe three, four inches below the pavement. Water comes down the street, goes everywhere but down the grate. Goes around it, into my lot, across the front step. Saturday after the storm, whole front was a pond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's from the coastal storm, Friday into Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that one. Two days ago and still puddle there this morning. And it's not the first time with that grate. Every hard rain, same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that sounds like a real nuisance. Let me make sure I have this right. The grate itself has settled lower than the road, and the water is bypassing it instead of draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Right. Bypassing. That's the word."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it right at the curb in front of the building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the curb, yeah. And there's something else. Manhole cover, ten feet up toward the corner. Looks off by an inch. Maybe a little more. Sits higher on one side. Cars hit it, bang. I don't know if that's same problem or different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that down as a second item so they look at both. Raised on one side, about an inch, ten feet up from the grate toward the corner. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Somebody's gonna blow a tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Is the grate blocked with leaves or debris, or is it really just the sinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I cleaned the leaves myself in December. It's not blocked. It's sunk. Believe me, I stood out there in the rain watching it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did any water get inside the shop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Came to the door. Sandbagged the sill, so no. But I shouldn't have to sandbag my own door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, understood. I'm writing it up for the highway crew as a sunken catch basin grate and a manhole cover that's off. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0174. That's the shop line. I'm there days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-four. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work weekends? Because if it rains again Saturday I'm right back where I was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a big storm they're out some weekend days, but regular repair work like this is mostly during the week. I'd expect them to look at it this week, ahead of the weekend, with the storm backlog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week. Okay. I'll believe it when I see the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. If nobody's been by and you want a status, call back and give them the address, 211 Farewell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:06:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gonna be out front anyway. My neighbor across, she's on the porch every day, waves at everybody walking by, cars, mailman, everybody. She'll tell me if a truck shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's handy to have. Anything else I can note for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Just fix the grate, and look at that manhole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:07:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both are on the ticket. Thanks for calling, Mr. Conti."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks, Lorraine."
    }
  ],
